WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
One more push. The cup moves when the paw touches it.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.500
Sneak up and swat the owner.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.700
Here comes the owner. Get around him or sit and look innocent.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.000
Ah Huai + Wumei. A collision during zoomies fires a shockwave.
